  "segments": [
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "In this scene, Nastya and Senya quietly discuss why Chef Barinov is so protective of his lost knife. Senya explains that it is an irreplaceable Japanese blade, and everyone must search thoroughly. Listen to the conversation in Russian first, and then we will examine it in English.",
      "gap": 0.8
    },
    {
      "v": "anya",
      "t": "Почему нельзя купить такой нож?",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "senya",
      "t": "По-быстрому такой нож купить не получится.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "anya",
      "t": "А сколько он стоит?",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "senya",
      "t": "Это дорогой японский нож.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "senya",
      "t": "Шеф заказывал его очень долго.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "anya",
      "t": "И он очень острый?",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "senya",
      "t": "Самый острый нож на кухне.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "anya",
      "t": "Где же он может быть?",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "senya",
      "t": "Мы уже везде искали.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "anya",
      "t": "Может, кто-то взял его домой?",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "senya",
      "t": "Никто не посмеет это сделать.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "senya",
      "t": "Шеф сразу всех уволит.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "senya",
      "t": "Давай нож ищи скорее.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "anya",
      "t": "Хорошо. Я посмотрю здесь.",
      "gap": 0.9
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Let's explore why this particular kitchen knife is so valuable to the chef.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "anya",
      "t": "Почему нельзя купить такой нож?",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Why can't we buy such a knife?' Nastya wonders why replacing the tool is so complicated.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "senya",
      "t": "По-быстрому такой нож купить не получится.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'You can't buy such a knife in a hurry.' Senya explains using the impersonal verb indicating that something will not work out.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "anya",
      "t": "А сколько он стоит?",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'And how much does it cost?' Asking about the financial value of the missing blade.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "senya",
      "t": "Это дорогой японский нож.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'This is an expensive Japanese knife.' Identifying the special craftsmanship and origin of the chef's tool.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "senya",
      "t": "Шеф заказывал его очень долго.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'The chef ordered it for a very long time.' Emphasizing how much effort went into acquiring it.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "anya",
      "t": "И он очень острый?",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'And is it very sharp?' Nastya asks about its cutting quality.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "senya",
      "t": "Самый острый нож на кухне.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'The sharpest knife in the kitchen.' A superlative construction meaning 'the most sharp'.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "anya",
      "t": "Где же он может быть?",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Where could it possibly be?' The emphatic particle adds urgency to the question.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "senya",
      "t": "Мы уже везде искали.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'We already looked everywhere.' Expressing frustration that all obvious places have been checked.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "anya",
      "t": "Может, кто-то взял его домой?",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Maybe someone took it home?' Suggesting a possible theft or accidental removal.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "senya",
      "t": "Никто не посмеет это сделать.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Nobody would dare do that.' The verb expresses courage or audacity to commit a forbidden act.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "senya",
      "t": "Шеф сразу всех уволит.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'The chef will fire everyone immediately.' Describing the drastic consequence if the knife was stolen.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "senya",
      "t": "Давай нож ищи скорее.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Come on, look for the knife quickly.' A renewed push to continue the kitchen search.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "anya",
      "t": "Хорошо.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'All right.' A brief agreement to comply.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "anya",
      "t": "Я посмотрю здесь.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'I will look here.' Promising to inspect her current station. Alright, let's hear the whole dialogue once more.",
